# Everything Claude keeps here is local to one machine and one session, EXCEPT
# the skills: those are how the project's own workflows are written down (see
# .claude/skills/app-mark), they reference this repo's files by path, and they
# are no more machine-local than DESIGN.md is.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/

# Compiled helpers. Unlike the .qsb shaders beside them, these are ELF for one
# architecture and would be wrong on any other machine that cloned this, so they
# are built rather than committed: `banditshell build`. The browser says so
# itself when they are missing, rather than failing quietly.
bin/bs-pty
bin/bs-ls
